## Forbidden

- Do not index `raw/`, `assets/`, `review/`, `sync/` directly
- Do not create new folders in `knowledge/` without confirming with the user
- Do not store secrets, tokens, passwords, private keys, banking data
- Do not copy third-party private data into `knowledge/`
- For sensitive material → `review/needs-redaction/` only
- Do not resolve a cross-base merge conflict by discarding one side wholesale — a
  fact present in only one version still belongs in the merged page (`16_MERGE.md`)
